    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement a PKCE login flow for public clients using a concrete external provider, I will choose Auth0 as the provider. Auth0 is a popular authentication service that supports PKCE (Proof Key for Code Exchange) for public clients. I will write the Python code to interact with Auth0's API for the PKCE login flow. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789888192085,
          "start": 1789888186412
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda6482c001TWy4WboUbaQ89u",
      "message_id": "msg_0bda643d9001Yo7QAaXZD2LeJf",
