    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `profile_claims.py` that fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Google People API for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that can be identified by its specific client library and API endpoint. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789888183356,
          "start": 1789888180051
        },
